Hello,

    Take a look at Ntop, http://www.ntop.org/ . VEry interesting package that
will give you tremendeous of information in real time via a Web Browser...and
you don't even need to install Apache, everything is built-in. However, you
can't manipulate the tables with that. You may want to investigate IpCop for
this task. http://ipcop.org/

    Good luck,

Eric

